Research Request: Where Annual-Report Information Lives

To: New finance analyst · From: Finance training lead · Session prep


REQUEST
Before Thursday's training session, please build a one-page map showing where three kinds of information are found in a US annual report on Form 10-K. Locate them; do not interpret any company's results.
# | Question
Q1 | Where is the business description located?
Q2 | Where is management's discussion and analysis located?
Q3 | Where are the audited financial statements located?

STARTING SOURCE
SEC, “How to Read a 10-K”: https://www.sec.gov/answers/reada10k.htm — the page shows it was modified 2011-07-01. Record the date you accessed it.

LIMITS
The SEC page is historical orientation, not a statement of current filing law. Mark any point that would need a current source before it is relied on.

Northstar Services is a fictional company. All names, figures, and dates are training material.
